WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.010
Diagnostic imaging helps clinicians visualize anatomy and evaluate disease or injury.

2
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:14.020
Radiographers combine patient care, accurate positioning, exposure selection, and image evaluation.

3
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:27.402
Remember the workflow: verify the patient, explain the exam, position accurately, expose safely, and evaluate the image before the patient leaves.
